---
title: Why agent slides fail
brief: >
  Three reasons agents produce weak decks get struck out on the left, and the one real
  cause, no way to observe the result, is revealed on the right.
notes: None of the three is the real problem. The agent never saw its own slide.
score:
  intro:
    - rise: [wrong, right]
      stagger: 100
      at: 140
    - slide: .guess
      stagger: 180
      at: 420
  steps:
    - name: strike the guesses
      each: .guess
      stagger: 180
      cues:
        - draw: $ .strike
          dur: 300
        - tint: $ .word
          from: ink
          opacity: 1
          at: 120
        - pop: $ .badge
          at: 160
        - ripple: $ .badge
          tone: danger
          r0: 6
          r1: 22
          at: 220
    - name: the real cause
      cues:
        - rise: cause
          from: [0, 10]
        - type: cause-text
          at: 120
        - draw: [link-a, link-b, link-c]
          dur: 320
          stagger: 60
          at: 320
        - rise: [see, point, check]
          from: [0, 16]
          dur: 340
          stagger: 60
          at: 420
---
<Header>Agents don't lack taste, they lack <em>eyes</em></Header>
<Diagram viewBox="0 0 1600 600" alt="Left: three assumed causes struck out. Right: the real cause, no way to observe the result, leads to three needs.">
  <Card id="wrong" x="20" y="16" w="700" h="560" tone="danger" label="What we blame" icon="circle-slash" />
  <g class="guess">
    <Icon name="paintbrush" x="52" y="150" size="30" />
    <text class="word big" x="104" y="177" style="fill:var(--struck)" opacity=".68">Weak design sense</text>
    <Strike class="strike" x1="96" x2="442" y="165" />
    <Badge class="badge" x="81" y="151" />
  </g>
  <g class="guess">
    <Icon name="book" x="52" y="290" size="30" />
    <text class="word big" x="104" y="317" style="fill:var(--struck)" opacity=".68">Too few templates</text>
    <Strike class="strike" x1="96" x2="438" y="305" />
    <Badge class="badge" x="81" y="291" />
  </g>
  <g class="guess">
    <Icon name="cpu" x="52" y="430" size="30" />
    <text class="word big" x="104" y="457" style="fill:var(--struck)" opacity=".68">The wrong model</text>
    <Strike class="strike" x1="96" x2="404" y="445" />
    <Badge class="badge" x="81" y="431" />
  </g>
  <Card id="right" x="750" y="16" w="830" h="560" tone="accent" label="What is actually missing" icon="eye" />
  <Box id="cause" x="782" y="96" w="766" h="120" tone="accent" />
  <text id="cause-text" class="big" x="812" y="168">No way to observe the result</text>
  <Box id="see" x="782" y="300" w="240" h="170" label="Frames" title="See any\nmoment" />
  <Box id="point" x="1045" y="300" w="240" h="170" label="Ids" title="Point at\nany part" />
  <Box id="check" x="1308" y="300" w="240" h="170" label="Diagnostics" title="Know what\nis wrong" />
  <Link id="link-a" from="cause" to="see" />
  <Link id="link-b" from="cause" to="point" />
  <Link id="link-c" from="cause" to="check" />
</Diagram>
